s Expertise は、Apache Arrow を基盤とする高性能 DataFrame ライブラリであり、Python と Rust をサポートしています","ko":"Polars Expertise는 Apache Arrow 기반의 고성능 DataFrame 라이브러리입니다. Python과 Rust를 지원합니다","es":"polars-expertise es una biblioteca de DataFrame de alto rendimiento para Python y Rust","fr":"polars-expertise est une bibliothèque de DataFrame haute performance pour Python et Rust","de":"polars-expertise ist eine hochleistungsfähige DataFrame-Bibliothek für Python und Rust","pt":"O que é Polars? Uma biblioteca Python de alto desempenho para processar e analisar dados","ru":"Что такое Поларс? Библиотека Python высокого уровня для обработки и анализа данных","ar":"ما هي أداة Polars؟ أداة بايثون عالية الأداء لتحليل البيانات"},"features":{"en":["Built on Apache Arrow for high-performance data processing","Supports Python and Rust with an expression-based API","Offers lazy evaluation for optimized execution","Provides automatic parallelization for efficient data analysis","Allows GPU support via pip install polars[gpu]","Enables eager and lazy execution modes for flexible data processing"],"zh":["基于 Apache Arrow 的高性能 DataFrame","支持 Python 和 Rust 语言","表达式基于 API 和懒惰评估","自动并行化和高性能数据处理","GPU 支持"],"ja":["Apache Arrow を基盤とする高性能 DataFrame","Python と Rust 言語のサポート","式ベースの API と遅延評価","自動並列化と高性能データ処理","GPU サポート"],"ko":["Apache Arrow 기반의 고성능 DataFrame","Python과 Rust 언어 지원","표현식 기반 API 및 Lazy 평가","자동 병렬화 및 고성능 데이터 처리","GPU 지원"],"es":["Soporte para Python y Rust","API basada en expresiones","Evaluación diferida","Paralelización automática","Compatibilidad con GPU"],"fr":["Prise en charge de Python et Rust","API basée sur des expressions","Évaluation différée","Parallélisation automatique","Compatibilité avec GPU"],"de":["Unterstützung für Python und Rust","Ausdrucksbasierte API","Verzögerte Auswertung","Automatische Parallelisierung","GPU-Unterstützung"],"pt":["Suporte a processamento paralelo automático","API baseada em expressões para processamento de dados","Avaliação lenta para otimização de desempenho","Suporte a GPU para processamento acelerado","Integração com Apache Arrow para alto desempenho"],"ru":["Автоматическая параллельная обработка данных","API на основе выражений для обработки данных","Ленивая оценка для оптимизации производительности","Поддержка GPU для ускорения обработки","Интеграция с Apache Arrow для высокопроизводительной обработки"],"ar":["دعم المعالجة الموازية الآلية","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات قائمة على التعبيرات لمعالجة البيانات","التقييم الكسول لتحسين الأداء","دعم وحدة معالجة الرسومات لتعزيز المعالجة","التكامل مع Apache Arrow لتحقيق أداء عال"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use polars-expertise","polars-expertise alternative","polars-expertise install","polars-expertise vs pandas","polars-expertise setup guide","polars-expertise gpu support","what is polars-expertise","polars-expertise documentation","polars-expertise tutorial"],"zh":["Polars Expertise","Python 数据处理","Apache Arrow","高性能 DataFrame","表达式基于 API","懒惰评估","自动并行化","GPU 支持"],"ja":["Polars Expertise","Python データ処理","Apache Arrow","高性能 DataFrame","式ベースの API","遅延評価","自動並列化","GPU サポート"],"ko":["Polars Expertise","Python 데이터 처리","Apache Arrow","고성능 DataFrame","표현식 기반 API","Lazy 평가","자동 병렬화","GPU 지원"],"es":["polars-expertise","Python","Rust","Apache Arrow","DataFrame","procesamiento de datos","análisis de datos","herramientas de AI","agentes de IA"],"fr":["polars-expertise","Python","Rust","Apache Arrow","DataFrame","traitement de données","analyse de données","outils d''IA","agents d''IA"],"de":["polars-expertise","Python","Rust","Apache Arrow","DataFrame","Datenverarbeitung","Datenanalyse","KI-Tools","KI-Agents"],"pt":["Polars","análise de dados","reflectividade resonante polarizada","processamento paralelo","Apache Arrow","GPU","Python","biblioteca de alto desempenho"],"ru":["Поларс","обработка данных","поляризованная резонансная отражательная способность","параллельная обработка","Apache Arrow","GPU","Python","библиотека высокого уровня"],"ar":["Polars","تحليل البيانات","الانعكاسية المتذبذبة المتناظرة","المعالجة الموازية","Apache Arrow","وحدة معالجة الرسومات","Python","أداة عالية الأداء"]}},"owner":"WSU-Carbon-Lab","repo":"pyref","repoPath":"WSU-Carbon-Lab/pyref","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.493Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"polars-expertise","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Polars\n\nHigh-performance DataFrame library built on Apache Arrow. Supports Python and Rust with expression-based API, lazy evaluation, and automatic parallelization.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Python\n\n```bash\nuv pip install polars\n# GPU support: uv pip install polars[gpu]\n```\n\n```python\nimport polars as pl\n\n# Eager: immediate execution\ndf = pl.DataFrame({\"symbol\": [\"AAPL\", \"GOOG\"], \"price\": [150.0, 140.0]})\ndf.filter(pl.col(\"price\") > 145).select(\"symbol\", \"price\")\n\n# Lazy: optimized execution (pref","body":"# Polars\n\nHigh-performance DataFrame library built on Apache Arrow. Supports Python and Rust with expression-based API, lazy evaluation, and automatic parallelization.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Python\n\n```bash\nuv pip install polars\n# GPU support: uv pip install polars[gpu]\n```\n\n```python\nimport polars as pl\n\n# Eager: immediate execution\ndf = pl.DataFrame({\"symbol\": [\"AAPL\", \"GOOG\"], \"price\": [150.0, 140.0]})\ndf.filter(pl.col(\"price\") > 145).select(\"symbol\", \"price\")\n\n# Lazy: optimized execution (preferred for large data)\nlf = pl.scan_parquet(\"trades.parquet\")\nresult = lf.filter(pl.col(\"volume\") > 1000).group_by(\"symbol\").agg(\n    pl.col(\"price\").mean().alias(\"avg_price\")\n).collect()\n```\n\n### Rust\n\n```toml\n# Cargo.toml - select features you need\n[dependencies]\npolars = { version = \"0.46\", features = [\"lazy\", \"parquet\", \"temporal\"] }\n```\n\n```rust\nuse polars::prelude::*;\n\nfn main() -> PolarsResult<()> {\n    // Eager\n    let df = df![\n        \"symbol\" => [\"AAPL\", \"GOOG\"],\n        \"price\" => [150.0, 140.0]\n    ]?;\n\n    // Lazy (preferred)\n    let lf = LazyFrame::scan_parquet(\"trades.parquet\", Default::default())?;\n    let result = lf\n        .filter(col(\"volume\").gt(lit(1000)))\n        .group_by([col(\"symbol\")])\n        .agg([col(\"price\").mean().alias(\"avg_price\")])\n        .collect()?;\n    Ok(())\n}\n```\n\n## Core Pattern: Expressions\n\nEverything in Polars is an expression. Expressions are composable, lazy, and parallelized.\n\n```python\n# Expression building blocks\npl.col(\"price\")                      # column reference\npl.col(\"price\") * pl.col(\"volume\")   # arithmetic\npl.col(\"price\").mean().over(\"symbol\") # window function\npl.when(cond).then(a).otherwise(b)   # conditional\n```\n\nExpressions execute in contexts: `select()`, `with_columns()`, `filter()`, `group_by().agg()`\n\n## When to Use Lazy\n\n| Use Lazy (`scan_*`, `.lazy()`) | Use Eager (`read_*`) |\n|-------------------------------|----------------------|\n| Large files (> RAM) | Small data, exploration |\n| Complex pipelines | Simple one-off ops |\n| Need query optimization | Interactive notebooks |\n| Streaming required | Immediate feedback |\n\nLazy benefits: predicate pushdown, projection pushdown, parallel execution, streaming.\n\n## Style: Use `.alias()` for Column Naming\n\nAlways use `.alias(\"name\")` instead of `name=expr` kwargs:\n\n```python\n# GOOD: Explicit .alias() - works everywhere, composable\ndf.with_columns(\n    (pl.col(\"price\") * pl.col(\"volume\")).alias(\"value\"),\n    pl.col(\"price\").mean().over(\"symbol\").alias(\"avg_price\")\n)\n\n# AVOID: Kwarg style - less flexible, doesn''t chain\ndf.with_columns(\n    value=pl.col(\"price\") * pl.col(\"volume\"),  # avoid\n    avg_price=pl.col(\"price\").mean().over(\"symbol\")  # avoid\n)\n```\n\n`.alias()` is explicit, chains with other methods, and works consistently in all contexts.\n\n## Anti-Patterns - AVOID\n\n```python\n# BAD: Python functions kill parallelization\ndf.with_columns(pl.col(\"x\").map_elements(lambda x: x * 2))  # SLOW\n\n# GOOD: Native expressions are parallel\ndf.with_columns((pl.col(\"x\") * 2).alias(\"x\"))  # FAST\n\n# BAD: Row iteration\nfor row in df.iter_rows():  # SLOW\n    process(row)\n\n# GOOD: Columnar operations\ndf.with_columns(process_expr)  # FAST\n\n# BAD: Late projection\nlf.filter(...).collect().select(\"a\", \"b\")  # reads all columns\n\n# GOOD: Early projection\nlf.select(\"a\", \"b\").filter(...).collect()  # reads only needed columns\n```\n\n## Performance Checklist\n\n- [ ] Using `scan_*` (lazy) for large files?\n- [ ] Projecting columns early in pipeline?\n- [ ] Using native expressions (no `map_elements`)?\n- [ ] Categorical dtype for low-cardinality strings?\n- [ ] Appropriate integer sizes (i32 vs i64)?\n- [ ] Streaming for out-of-memory data? (`collect(engine=\"streaming\")`)\n\n## Reference Navigator\n\n### Python References\n\n| Topic | File | When to Load |\n|-------|------|--------------|\n| Expressions, types, lazy/eager | [python/core_concepts.md](references/python/core_concepts.md) | Understanding fundamentals |\n| Select, filter, group_by, window | [python/operations.md](references/python/operations.md) | Common operations |\n| CSV, Parquet, streaming I/O | [python/io_guide.md](references/python/io_guide.md) | Reading/writing data |\n| Joins, pivots, reshaping | [python/transformations.md](references/python/transformations.md) | Combining/reshaping data |\n| Performance, patterns | [python/best_practices.md](references/python/best_practices.md) | Optimization |\n\n### Rust References\n\n| Topic | File | When to Load |\n|-------|------|--------------|\n| DataFrame, Series, ChunkedArray | [rust/core_concepts.md](references/rust/core_concepts.md) | Rust API fundamentals |\n| Expression API in Rust | [rust/operations.md](references/rust/operations.md) | Operations syntax |\n| Readers, writers, streaming | [rust/io_guide.md](references/rust/io_guide.md) | I/O operations |\n| Feature flags, crates | [rust/features.md](references/rust/features.md) | Cargo setup |\n| Allocators, SIMD, nightly | [rust/performance.md](references/rust/performance.md) | Performance tuning |\n| Zero-copy, FFI, Arrow | [rust/arrow_interop.md](references/rust/arrow_interop.md) | Arrow integration |\n\n### Shared References\n\n| Topic | File | When to Load |\n|-------|------|--------------|\n| SQL queries on DataFrames | [sql_interface.md](references/sql_interface.md) | SQL syntax needed |\n| Query optimization, streaming | [lazy_deep_dive.md](references/lazy_deep_dive.md) | Understanding lazy engine |\n| NVIDIA GPU acceleration | [gpu_support.md](references/gpu_support.md) | GPU setup/usage |\n\n### Migration Guides\n\n| From | File | When to Load |\n|------|------|--------------|\n| pandas | [migration_pandas.md](references/migration_pandas.md) | Converting pandas code |\n| PySpark | [migration_spark.md](references/migration_spark.md) | Converting Spark code |\n| q/kdb+ | [migration_qkdb.md](references/migration_qkdb.md) | Converting kdb code |\n\n## Time Series / Financial Data Quick Patterns\n\n```python\n# OHLCV resampling\ndf.group_by_dynamic(\"timestamp\", every=\"1m\").agg(\n    pl.col(\"price\").first().alias(\"open\"),\n    pl.col(\"price\").max().alias(\"high\"),\n    pl.col(\"price\").min().alias(\"low\"),\n    pl.col(\"price\").last().alias(\"close\"),\n    pl.col(\"volume\").sum()\n)\n\n# Rolling statistics\ndf.with_columns(\n    pl.col(\"price\").rolling_mean(window_size=20).alias(\"sma_20\"),\n    pl.col(\"price\").rolling_std(window_size=20).alias(\"volatility\")\n)\n\n# As-of join for market data alignment\ntrades.join_asof(quotes, on=\"timestamp\", by=\"symbol\", strategy=\"backward\")\n```\n\nLoad [python/best_practices.md](references/python/best_practices.md) for comprehensive time series patterns.\n\n## Runnable Examples\n\n| Example | File | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| Financial OHLCV | [examples/financial_ohlcv.py](examples/financial_ohlcv.py) | OHLCV resampling, rolling stats, VWAP |\n| Pandas Migration | [examples/pandas_migration.py](examples/pandas_migration.py) | Side-by-side pandas vs polars |\n| Streaming Large Files | [examples/streaming_large_file.py](examples/streaming_large_file.py) | Out-of-memory processing patterns |\n\n## Development Tips\n\nUse LSP for navigating Polars code:\n- **Python**: Pyright/Pylance provides excellent type inference for Polars expressions\n- **Rust**: rust-analyzer understands Polars types and expression chains\n\nLSP operations like `goToDefinition` and `hover` help explore Polars API without leaving the editor.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:10.997Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing high-performance DataFrame processing and Polarized Resonant Reflectivity Data analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能DataFrame处理和偏振共振反射率数据分析能力的数据分析代理。","ja":"高性能のDataFrame処理と偏振共鳴反射率データ分析能力を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"높은 성능의 DataFrame 처리 및 편광 공진 반사율 데이터 분석 기능이 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan un procesamiento de DataFrame de alto rendimiento y capacidades de análisis de datos de Reflectividad Resonante Polarizada.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Données nécessitant un traitement de DataFrame haute performance et des capacités d''analyse de données de Réflexivité Résonnante Polarisation.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die eine hochleistungsstarke DataFrame-Verarbeitung und eine Analyse von Polarisierten Resonanz-Reflektivitäts-Daten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de processamento de DataFrame de alto desempenho e capacidades de análise de dados de reflexividade ressonante polarizada.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым требуются высокопроизводительные возможности обработки DataFrame и анализ данных поляризованной резонансной отражательной способности.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليليين للبيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة إطار البيانات الأداء العالي وقدرات تحليل بيانات الانعكاسية المتماثلة القطبية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently process large datasets using Apache Arrow, with features like expression-based API, lazy evaluation, and automatic parallelization, supporting both Python and Rust.","zh":"赋予代理高效处理大型数据集的能力，使用Apache Arrow，具有基于表达式的API、惰性评估和自动并行化等功能，支持Python和Rust。","ja":"Apache Arrowを使用して、エージェントが大規模なデータセットを効率的に処理できるようにし、式ベースのAPI、遅延評価、自動並列化などの機能を提供し、PythonとRustの両方をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 대규모 데이터 집합을 효율적으로 처리할 수 있도록 하며 Apache Arrow를 사용하여 표현식 기반 API, 지연 평가 및 자동 병렬화 등의 기능을 제공하며 Python 및 Rust를 모두 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a procesar eficientemente grandes conjuntos de datos utilizando Apache Arrow, con características como API basada en expresiones, evaluación diferida y paralelización automática, compatible con Python y Rust.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter efficacement de grands ensembles de données à l''aide d''Apache Arrow, avec des fonctionnalités comme API basée sur des expressions, évaluation différée et parallélisation automatique, prenant en charge Python et Rust.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, große Datensätze effizient mithilfe von Apache Arrow zu verarbeiten, mit Funktionen wie ausdrucksbasierte API, verzögerte Auswertung und automatische Parallelisierung, unterstützt sowohl Python als auch Rust.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a processar conjuntos de dados grandes de forma eficiente usando Apache Arrow, com recursos como API baseada em expressões, avaliação preguiçosa e paralelização automática, suportando Python e Rust.","ru":"Позволяет агентам эффективно обрабатывать большие наборы данных с помощью Apache Arrow, с функциями zoals API на основе выражений, ленивую оценку и автоматическую параллелизацию, поддерживая Python и Rust.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من معالجة مجموعات بيانات كبيرة بفعالية باستخدام Apache Arrow، مع ميزات مثل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات القائمة على التعبير، وتقييم الكسول، والتوازي التلقائي، ودعم Python وRust."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing Polarized Resonant Reflectivity Data for scientific research","Optimizing data processing workflows with lazy evaluation and parallelization","Building high-performance data pipelines with Python and Rust"],"zh":["为科学研究分析偏振共振反射率数据","使用延迟评估和并行化优化数据处理工作流","使用Python和Rust构建高性能数据管道"],"ja":["科学研究のための偏振共鳴反射率データの分析","遅延評価と並列化を使用したデータ処理ワークフローの最適化","PythonとRustを使用した高性能データパイプラインの構築"],"ko":["과학 연구를 위한 편광 공진 반사율 데이터 분석","지연 평가 및 병렬화를 사용한 데이터 처리 워크플로 최적화","Python 및 Rust를 사용한 고성능 데이터 파이프라인 구축"],"es":["Análisis de datos de Reflectividad Resonante Polarizada para la investigación científica","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de procesamiento de datos con evaluación diferida y paralelización","Creación de canalizaciones de datos de alto rendimiento con Python y Rust"],"fr":["Analyse de données de Réflexivité Résonnante Polarisation pour la recherche scientifique","Optimisation des flux de travail de traitement de données avec évaluation différée et parallélisation","Conception de pipelines de données haute performance avec Python et Rust"],"de":["Analyse von Daten der Polarisierten Resonanz-Reflektivität für wissenschaftliche Forschung","Optimierung von Datenverarbeitungs-Workflows mit verzögerter Auswertung und Parallelisierung","Erstellung von Hochleistungs-Datensätzen mit Python und Rust"],"pt":["Analisar dados de reflexividade ressonante polarizada para pesquisa científica","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de processamento de dados com avaliação preguiçosa e paralelização","Construir pipelines de dados de alto desempenho com Python e Rust"],"ru":["Анализ данных поляризованной резонансной отражательной способности для научных исследований","Оптимизация потоков обработки данных с ленивой оценкой и параллелизацией","Создание высокопроизводительных конвейеров данных с Python и Rust"],"ar":["تحليل بيانات الانعكاسية المتماثلة القطبية لأغراض البحث العلمي","تحسين سير عمل معالجة البيانات باستخدام التقييم الكسول والتوازي","بناء خطوط أنابيب بيانات عالية الأداء باستخدام Python وRust"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python or Rust environment","GPU support requires additional installation"],"zh":["需要Python或Rust环境","GPU支持需要额外安装"],"ja":["PythonまたはRust環境が必要","GPUサポートには追加のインストールが必要"],"ko":["Python 또는 Rust 환경이 필요함","GPU 지원에는 추가 설치가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python o Rust","El soporte de GPU requiere una instalación adicional"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python ou Rust","La prise en charge de GPU nécessite une installation supplémentaire"],"de":["Benötigt Python- oder Rust-Umgebung","GPU-Unterstützung erfordert eine zusätzliche Installation"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python ou Rust","Suporte a GPU requer instalação adicional"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python или Rust","Поддержка GPU требует дополнительной установки"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python أو Rust","دعم GPU يتطلب تركيبًا إضافيًا"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"16cf49e414cdfb653c9a26e6fd56f1c3bc68f70b57fd2c90493f63463ad442fb","qualityScore":48}');
