,"CLI para desarrollo eficiente"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le développement","orchestration de flux de travail","automatisation de tâches avec Node.js","Synkra AIOS alternative","guides d''installation de Synkra AIOS","développement full stack avec IA","agents d''IA pour l''automatisation","CLI pour un développement efficace"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","Orchestrierung von Arbeitsabläufen","Automatisierung von Aufgaben mit Node.js","Synkra AIOS Alternative","Installationsanleitungen für Synkra AIOS","Full-Stack-Entwicklung mit KI","KI-Agents für die Automatisierung","CLI für eine effiziente Entwicklung"],"pt":["ferramentas de AI Agents","desenvolvimento full stack","orquestração de IA","Node.js","TypeScript","CLI","automação","produtividade","eficiência"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","полноэкранное разработка","оркестровка ИИ","Node.js","TypeScript","CLI","автоматизация","производительность","эффективность"],"ar":["أدوات الإيجنت الذكية","تنمية التطبيقات الكاملة","أوركسترا ذكاء اصطناعي","Node.js","TypeScript","CLI","التحكم الآلي","الإنتاجية","الكفاءة"]}},"owner":"SynkraAI","repo":"aios-core","repoPath":"SynkraAI/aios-core","stars":1850,"forks":634,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T07:36:33Z","topics":["agents","ai","ai-agents","automation","claude","cli","development","framework","fullstack","nodejs","orchestration","typescript"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aios-analyst","description":"Business Analyst (Atlas). Use for market research, competitive analysis, user research, brainstorming session facilitation, structured ideation workshops, feasibility studies, i...","bodyPreview":"# AIOS Business Analyst Activator\n\n## When To Use\nUse for market research, competitive analysis, user research, brainstorming session facilitation, structured ideation workshops, feasibility studies, industry trends analysis, project discovery (brownfield documentati...\n\n## Activation Protocol\n1. Load `.aios-core/development/agents/analyst.md` as source of truth (fallback: `.codex/agents/analyst.md`).\n2. Adopt this agent persona and command system.\n3. Generate greeting via `node .aios-core/devel","body":"# AIOS Business Analyst Activator\n\n## When To Use\nUse for market research, competitive analysis, user research, brainstorming session facilitation, structured ideation workshops, feasibility studies, industry trends analysis, project discovery (brownfield documentati...\n\n## Activation Protocol\n1. Load `.aios-core/development/agents/analyst.md` as source of truth (fallback: `.codex/agents/analyst.md`).\n2. Adopt this agent persona and command system.\n3. Generate greeting via `node .aios-core/development/scripts/generate-greeting.js analyst` and show it first.\n4. Stay in this persona until the user asks to switch or exit.\n\n## Starter Commands\n- `*help` - Show all available commands with descriptions\n- `*create-project-brief` - Create project brief document\n- `*perform-market-research` - Create market research analysis\n- `*create-competitor-analysis` - Create competitive analysis\n- `*brainstorm` - Facilitate structured brainstorming\n- `*guide` - Show comprehensive usage guide for this agent\n\n## Non-Negotiables\n- Follow `.aios-core/constitution.md`.\n- Execute workflows/tasks only from declared dependencies.\n- Do not invent requirements outside the project artifacts.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:27:13.414Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced market research and competitive analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级市场研究和竞争分析能力的Python分析代理。","ja":"Python分析エージェントが高度な市場調査と競合分析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 시장 분석 및 경쟁 분석 기능을 필요로 하는 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de investigación de mercado y análisis competitivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Python nécessitant des capacités avancées de recherche de marché et d''analyse concurrentielle.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Marktforschungs- und Wettbewerbsanalysefähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de pesquisa de mercado e análise competitiva.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов анализа на Python, которым требуются расширенные возможности исследования рынка и конкурентного анализа.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التحليل باستخدام Python الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة في أبحاث السوق والتحليل التنافسي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze market trends, facilitate brainstorming sessions, and generate structured ideation workshops using Synkra AIOS. It provides a core framework for full-stack development, enabling agents to perform comprehensive content analysis and feasibility studies.","zh":"赋予代理分析市场趋势、促进头脑风暴会议、并使用Synkra AIOS生成结构化的想法研讨会的能力。它为全栈开发提供了核心框架，允许代理执行全面内容分析和可行性研究。","ja":"エージェントが市場のトレンドを分析し、ブレインストーミング・セッションを促進し、Synkra AIOSを使用して構造化されたアイデアワークショップを生成する能力を提供します。フルスタック開発のためのコアフレームワークを提供し、エージェントが包括的なコンテンツ分析と実行可能性研究を実行できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 시장 동향을 분석하고 브레인스토밍 세션을 촉진하며 Synkra AIOS를 사용하여 구조화된 아이디어 워크숍을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. 풀스택 개발을 위한 핵심 프레임워크를 제공하여 에이전트가 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석 및 실현 가능성 연구를 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Potencia a los agentes para analizar tendencias del mercado, facilitar sesiones de brainstorming y generar talleres de ideación estructurados utilizando Synkra AIOS. Proporciona un framework central para el desarrollo full-stack, permitiendo a los agentes realizar análisis de contenido exhaustivos y estudios de viabilidad.","fr":"Donne aux agents la capacité d''analyser les tendances du marché, de faciliter des sessions de brainstorming et de générer des ateliers d''idéation structurés en utilisant Synkra AIOS. Il fournit un framework de base pour le développement full-stack, permettant aux agents d''effectuer une analyse de contenu complète et des études de faisabilité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Markttrends zu analysieren, Brainstorming-Sitzungen zu erleichtern und strukturierte Ideenworkshops mit Synkra AIOS zu generieren. Es bietet einen Core-Framework für die Full-Stack-Entwicklung, der es Agents ermöglicht, umfassende Inhaltsanalysen und Machbarkeitsstudien durchzuführen.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a analisar tendências de mercado, facilitar sessões de brainstorming e gerar workshops de ideação estruturados usando o Synkra AIOS. Fornece um framework central para desenvolvimento full-stack, permitindo que os agentes realizem análises de conteúdo abrangentes e estudos de viabilidade.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать рыночные тенденции, проводить мозговые штурмы и организовывать структурированные воркшопы по генерации идей с использованием Synkra AIOS. Предоставляет основную framework для полнофункциональной разработки, позволяя агентам выполнять комплексный анализ контента и исследования осуществимости.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل اتجاهات السوق، وتسهيل جلسات العصف الذهني، وإنشاء ورش عمل منظمة لتوليد الأفكار باستخدام Synkra AIOS. يوفر إطار عمل أساسيًا للتطوير الشامل، مما يمكن الوكلاء من إجراء تحليل محتوى شامل ودراسات الجدوى."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating market research","Generating competitive analysis reports","Facilitating brainstorming sessions for product discovery"],"zh":["自动化市场研究","生成竞争分析报告","促进产品发现的头脑风暴会议"],"ja":["市場調査の自動化","競合分析レポートの生成","製品発見のためのブレインストーミング・セッションの促進"],"ko":["시장 조사 자동화","경쟁 분석 보고서 생성","제품 발견을 위한 브레인스토밍 세션 촉진"],"es":["Automatización de la investigación de mercado","Generación de informes de análisis competitivo","Facilitación de sesiones de brainstorming para el descubrimiento de productos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la recherche de marché","Génération de rapports d''analyse concurrentielle","Facilitation de sessions de brainstorming pour la découverte de produits"],"de":["Automatisierung der Marktforschung","Erstellung von Wettbewerbsanalyseberichten","Durchführung von Brainstorming-Sitzungen für die Produktentdeckung"],"pt":["Automatização de pesquisas de mercado","Geração de relatórios de análise competitiva","Facilitação de sessões de brainstorming para descoberta de produtos"],"ru":["Автоматизация исследования рынка","Создание отчетов конкурентного анализа","Проведение мозговых штурмов для исследования продукта"],"ar":["أتمتة أبحاث السوق","إنشاء تقارير التحليل التنافسي","تسهيل جلسات العصف الذهني لاكتشاف المنتجات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Synkra AIOS core framework v4.0","Python only"],"zh":["需要Synkra AIOS核心框架v4.0","仅限Python"],"ja":["Synkra AIOSコアフレームワークv4.0が必要","Pythonのみ"],"ko":["Synkra AIOS 핵심 프레임워크 v4.0 필요","Python만"],"es":["Requiere el framework central Synkra AIOS v4.0","Solo Python"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework core Synkra AIOS v4.0","Python uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert das Synkra AIOS Core-Framework v4.0","Nur Python"],"pt":["Requer o framework principal Synkra AIOS v4.0","Apenas Python"],"ru":["Требует основную framework Synkra AIOS v4.0","Только Python"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار العمل الأساسي Synkra AIOS الإصدار 4.0","يعمل مع Python فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7393efc370b264c83fe201db8cc66a6a71ba72895ddedd05205e0ddc87a7c4b9","qualityScore":48}');
