und erweiterbare Architektur","Automatisierung von Entwicklungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Orquestração de agentes IA para desenvolvimento full stack","CLI integrado para automação de fluxos de trabalho","Suporte nativo para Node.js e TypeScript","Arquitetura modular e extensível","Integração com ecossistema Claude AI","Automação de tarefas de desenvolvimento complexas"],"ru":["Оркестрация ИИ агентов для full stack разработки","Интегрированный CLI для автоматизации рабочих процессов","Нативная поддержка Node.js и TypeScript","Модульная и расширяемая архитектура","Интеграция с экосистемой Claude AI","Автоматизация сложных задач разработки"],"ar":["تنسيق أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتطوير الشامل","CLI مدمج لأتمتة سير العمل","دعم أصلي لـ Node.js و TypeScript","هندسة معيارية وقابلة للتوسيع","تكامل مع نظام Claude AI","أتمتة مهام التطوير المعقدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体框架","Node.js自动化工具","全栈开发AI代理","AIOS安装指南","Claude AI集成","TypeScript AI编排","AI开发工具比较","自动化工作流设置"],"ja":["AIエージェントフレームワーク","Node.js自動化ツール","フルスタック開発AIエージェント","AIOSインストール方法","Claude AI連携","TypeScript AIオーケストレーション","AI開発ツール比較","自動化ワークフロー設定"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 프레임워크","Node.js 자동화 도구","풀스택 개발 AI 에이전트","AIOS 설치 가이드","Claude AI 연동","TypeScript AI 오케스트레이션","AI 개발 도구 비교","자동화 워크플로우 설정"],"es":["framework agentes IA desarrollo","Synkra AIOS install","orquestación IA full stack","automatización desarrollo con Claude","Node.js agentes IA","TypeScript framework IA","Synkra AIOS vs LangChain","como usar agentes IA desarrollo","CLI automatización tareas","setup Synkra AIOS guide"],"fr":["framework outils IA développement","Synkra AIOS install","orchestration IA full stack","automatisation développement avec Claude","Node.js outils IA","TypeScript framework IA","Synkra AIOS vs LangChain","comment utiliser outils IA développement","CLI automatisation tâches","guide setup Synkra AIOS"],"de":["KI-Agenten Framework Entwicklung","Synkra AIOS installieren","KI Orchestrierung Full Stack","Automatisierung Entwicklung mit Claude","Node.js KI Agenten","TypeScript KI Framework","Synkra AIOS vs LangChain","wie verwendet man KI Agenten Entwicklung","CLI Aufgabenautomatisierung","Synkra AIOS Setup Anleitung"],"pt":["framework agentes IA desenvolvimento","como usar Synkra AIOS","automação desenvolvimento full stack","Synkra AIOS vs LangChain","instalar Synkra AIOS CLI","orquestração agentes AI Node.js","tutorial Synkra AIOS TypeScript","ferramentas IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["фреймворк ИИ агентов разработка","как использовать Synkra AIOS","автоматизация full stack разработки","Synkra AIOS vs LangChain","установка Synkra AIOS CLI","оркестрация ИИ агентов Node.js","руководство Synkra AIOS TypeScript","ИИ инструменты для разработчиков"],"ar":["إطار عمل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتطوير","كيفية استخدام Synkra AIOS","أتمتة التطوير الشامل","Synkra AIOS مقابل LangChain","تثبيت Synkra AIOS CLI","تنسيق أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي Node.js","برنامج تعليمي Synkra AIOS TypeScript","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"SynkraAI","repo":"aios-core","repoPath":"SynkraAI/aios-core","stars":1899,"forks":655,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T12:35:32Z","topics":["agents","ai","ai-agents","automation","claude","cli","development","framework","fullstack","nodejs","orchestration","typescript"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aios-sm","description":"Scrum Master (River). Use for user story creation from PRD, story validation and completeness checking, acceptance criteria definition, story refinement, sprint planning, backlo...","bodyPreview":"# AIOS Scrum Master Activator\n\n## When To Use\nUse for user story creation from PRD, story validation and completeness checking, acceptance criteria definition, story refinement, sprint planning, backlog grooming, retrospectives, daily standup facilitation, and lo...\n\n## Activation Protocol\n1. Load `.aios-core/development/agents/sm.md` as source of truth (fallback: `.codex/agents/sm.md`).\n2. Adopt this agent persona and command system.\n3. Generate greeting via `node .aios-core/development/scripts","body":"# AIOS Scrum Master Activator\n\n## When To Use\nUse for user story creation from PRD, story validation and completeness checking, acceptance criteria definition, story refinement, sprint planning, backlog grooming, retrospectives, daily standup facilitation, and lo...\n\n## Activation Protocol\n1. Load `.aios-core/development/agents/sm.md` as source of truth (fallback: `.codex/agents/sm.md`).\n2. Adopt this agent persona and command system.\n3. Generate greeting via `node .aios-core/development/scripts/generate-greeting.js sm` and show it first.\n4. Stay in this persona until the user asks to switch or exit.\n\n## Starter Commands\n- `*help` - Show all available commands with descriptions\n- `*draft` - Create next user story\n- `*story-checklist` - Run story draft checklist\n- `*guide` - Show comprehensive usage guide for this agent\n\n## Non-Negotiables\n- Follow `.aios-core/constitution.md`.\n- Execute workflows/tasks only from declared dependencies.\n- Do not invent requirements outside the project artifacts.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T12:48:04.363Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Scrum Master Agents orchestrating full-stack development workflows from PRD to deployment.","zh":"适用于AI Scrum Master Agents编排从PRD到部署的全栈开发工作流。","ja":"PRDからデプロイまでのフルスタック開発ワークフローをオーケストレーションするAI Scrum Masterエージェントに適しています。","ko":"PRD에서 배포까지의 전체 스택 개발 워크플로우를 오케스트레이션하는 AI Scrum Master 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para AI Scrum Master Agents que orquestran flujos de trabajo de desarrollo full-stack desde el PRD hasta la implementación.","fr":"Idéal pour les AI Scrum Master Agents orchestrant des flux de travail de développement full-stack du PRD au déploiement.","de":"Ideal für AI Scrum Master Agents, die Full-Stack-Entwicklungsworkflows von PRD bis zur Bereitstellung orchestrieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Scrum Master de IA que orquestram fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento full-stack do PRD até a implantação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Scrum Master ИИ, оркестрирующих рабочие потоки полного стека разработки от PRD до развертывания.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Scrum Master الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يقوم بorchestrating تدفقات عمل التطوير الكامل من PRD إلى النشر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Transforms agents into complete Scrum Masters capable of generating user stories from PRDs, validating story completeness, defining acceptance criteria, and facilitating sprint planning, backlog grooming, and retrospectives. Leverages the Synkra AIOS Core Framework v4.0 for structured development orchestration.","zh":"将代理转变为能够从PRD中生成用户故事、验证故事完整性、定义接受标准并促进冲刺规划、积压梳理和回顾的完整Scrum Masters。利用Synkra AIOS Core Framework v4.0进行结构化开发编排。","ja":"エージェントをPRDからユーザー・ストーリーを生成し、ストーリーの完全性を検証し、受け入れ基準を定義し、スプリント計画、バックログの整理、回顧を促進する完全なScrum Mastersに変換します。構造化開発のオーケストレーションのためにSynkra AIOS Core Framework v4.0を利用します。","ko":"에이전트를 PRD에서 사용자 스토리를 생성하고 스토리의 완전성을 검증하고 수용 기준을 정의하고 스프린트 계획, 백로그 정리, 회고를 촉진하는 완전한 Scrum Masters로 변환합니다. 구조화된 개발 오케스트레이션을 위해 Synkra AIOS Core Framework v4.0를 활용합니다.","es":"Transforma a los agents en Scrum Masters completos capaces de generar user stories a partir de PRDs, validar la completitud de las historias, definir acceptance criteria y facilitar la sprint planning, el backlog grooming y las retrospectives. Aprovecha el Synkra AIOS Core Framework v4.0 para una orquestación de desarrollo estructurada.","fr":"Transforme les agents en Scrum Masters complets capables de générer des user stories à partir de PRDs, de valider l''exhaustivité des histoires, de définir des acceptance criteria et de faciliter la sprint planning, le backlog grooming et les retrospectives. Tire parti du Synkra AIOS Core Framework v4.0 pour une orchestration de développement structurée.","de":"Verwandelt Agents in vollwertige Scrum Masters, die in der Lage sind, User Stories aus PRDs zu generieren, die Vollständigkeit von Stories zu validieren, Acceptance Criteria zu definieren und Sprint Planning, Backlog Grooming sowie Retrospectives zu ermöglichen. Nutzt das Synkra AIOS Core Framework v4.0 für eine strukturierte Entwicklungsorchestrierung.","pt":"Transforma os agentes em Scrum Masters completos capazes de gerar histórias de usuário a partir de PRDs, validar a completude da história, definir critérios de aceitação e facilitar a planejamento de sprint, grooming de backlog e retrospectivas. Utiliza o Synkra AIOS Core Framework v4.0 para orquestração de desenvolvimento estruturada.","ru":"Преобразует агентов в полноценных мастеров Scrum, способных генерировать истории пользователей из PRD, проверять полноту истории, определять критерии приемки и облегчать планирование спринта, уход за бэклогом и ретроспективы. Использует Synkra AIOS Core Framework v4.0 для структурированной оркестрации разработки.","ar":"يحول العميل إلى أسياد Scrum كاملة القدرة على توليد قصص المستخدم من PRDs ، و التحقق من اكتمال القصة ، و تعريف معايير القبول ، و تسهيل تخطيط Sprint ، و تنمية قائمة الانتظار ، و الاجتماعات التأملية. يستخدم الإطار الأساسي Synkra AIOS Core v4.0 لتوجيه تنمية منظم."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating user stories from Product Requirement Documents (PRDs)","Validating story completeness and acceptance criteria","Facilitating sprint planning and backlog grooming sessions","Running daily standups and retrospective meetings"],"zh":["从产品需求文档（PRD）生成用户故事","验证故事的完整性和接受标准","促进冲刺规划和积压梳理会议","运行每日站立会议和回顾会议"],"ja":["プロダクト要件文書（PRD）からユーザー・ストーリーを生成する","ストーリーの完全性と受け入れ基準を検証する","スプリント計画とバックログの整理会議を促進する","毎日の立ち上がり会議と回顧会議を実行する"],"ko":["제품 요구 사항 문서（PRD）에서 사용자 스토리를 생성하는","스토리의 완전성과 수용 기준을 검증하는","스프린트 계획 및 백로그 정리 회의를 촉진하는","매일의 선두 회의 및 회고 회의를 실행하는"],"es":["Generar user stories a partir de Product Requirement Documents (PRDs)","Validar la completitud de las historias y los acceptance criteria","Facilitar sesiones de sprint planning y backlog grooming","Dirigir daily standups y retrospective meetings"],"fr":["Génération de user stories à partir de Product Requirement Documents (PRDs)","Validation de l''exhaustivité des histoires et des acceptance criteria","Facilitation des sessions de sprint planning et de backlog grooming","Animation des daily standups et des retrospective meetings"],"de":["Generieren von User Stories aus Product Requirement Documents (PRDs)","Validieren der Story-Vollständigkeit und der Acceptance Criteria","Durchführen von Sprint Planning und Backlog Grooming Sessions","Abhalten von Daily Standups und Retrospective Meetings"],"pt":["Geração de histórias de usuário a partir de Documentos de Requisitos de Produto (PRDs)","Validação da completude da história e critérios de aceitação","Facilitação de sessões de planejamento de sprint e grooming de backlog","Realização de reuniões diárias e retrospectivas"],"ru":["Генерация историй пользователей из документов требований продукта (PRD)","Проверка полноты истории и критериев приемки","Облегчение планирования спринта и ухода за бэклогом","Проведение ежедневных встреч и ретроспектив"],"ar":["توليد قصص المستخدم من وثائق متطلبات المنتج (PRDs)","التحقق من اكتمال القصة و معايير القبول","تسهيل اجتماعات تخطيط Sprint و تنمية قائمة الانتظار","تنفيذ الاجتماعات اليومية و الاجتماعات التأملية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to .aios-core/development/agents/sm.md configuration file","Dependent on Node.js for script execution via aios-core scripts","Needs structured PRD input for optimal story generation"],"zh":["需要访问.aios-core/development/agents/sm.md配置文件","依赖于Node.js通过aios-core脚本执行脚本","需要结构化的PRD输入以实现最佳的故事生成"],"ja":[".aios-core/development/agents/sm.md設定ファイルへのアクセスが必要","スクリプトの実行にはaios-coreスクリプトを介したNode.jsに依存する","最適なストーリー生成のために構造化されたPRD入力が必要"],"ko":[".aios-core/development/agents/sm.md 구성 파일에 액세스해야 함","스크립트 실행을 위해 aios-core 스크립트를 통해 Node.js에 의존함","최적의 스토리 생성을 위해 구조화된 PRD 입력이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo de configuración .aios-core/development/agents/sm.md","Depende de Node.js para la ejecución de scripts a través de los scripts aios-core","Necesita una entrada de PRD estructurada para una generación óptima de historias"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au fichier de configuration .aios-core/development/agents/sm.md","Dépend de Node.js pour l''exécution des scripts via les scripts aios-core","Nécessite une entrée PRD structurée pour une génération d''histoires optimale"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Konfigurationsdatei .aios-core/development/agents/sm.md","Ist für die Skriptausführung über aios-core-Skripte von Node.js abhängig","Benötigt strukturierte PRD-Eingaben für eine optimale Story-Generierung"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao arquivo de configuração .aios-core/development/agents/sm.md","Dependente do Node.js para execução de scripts via scripts do aios-core","Precisa de entrada de PRD estruturada para geração ótima de histórias"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу конфигурации .aios-core/development/agents/sm.md","Зависит от Node.js для выполнения скриптов через скрипты aios-core","Требует структурированного ввода PRD для оптимальной генерации историй"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف التكوين .aios-core/development/agents/sm.md","يعتمد على Node.js لتنفيذ البرامج النصية عبر برامج نصية aios-core","يتطلب إدخال PRD المنظم للحصول على جودة قصص الجيدة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f340516e649f508f4ed9fb832a1517f42955849f9b3dad760ad1fbcc1f3df382","qualityScore":48}');
