INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('tractorjuice/arc-kit/auto-memory', 'auto-memory', 'tractorjuice', 'arc-kit', 'community', 'auto-memory tractorjuice arc-kit community The auto-memory skill enables developers to retain project knowledge across Claude Code sessions using a persistent memory directory. It benefits enterprise architecture governance and vendor procurement teams. Auto-Memory 是一种用于企业架构治理和供应商采购的工具包，通过持久化 auto memory 实现项目知识的保留和结构化管理 Auto-Memory はエンタープライズアーキテクチャガバナンスとベンダー調達のためのツールキットで、永続的な auto memory を使用してプロジェクトの知識を保留し、構造化します Auto-Memory는 엔터프라이즈 아키텍처 거버넌스와 벤더 조달을 위한 툴킷으로, 영속적인 auto memory를 사용하여 프로젝트 지식을 보존하고 구조화합니다 La función de auto-memoria utiliza un directorio de memoria persistente para retener el conocimiento del proyecto. Mejora la gestión de la arquitectura empresarial L''auto-mémoire utilise un répertoire de mémoire persistant pour conserver les connaissances de projet. Améliorez la gestion de l''architecture d''entreprise Die Auto-Speicher-Funktion nutzt ein persistierendes Speicherverzeichnis, um Projektwissen zu speichern. Verbessern Sie die Unternehmensarchitekturverwaltung O auto-memória é uma ferramenta de governança de arquitetura de empresa que retém conhecimento de projetos em sessões de Claude Code Авто-память - это инструмент управления архитектурой предприятия, который сохраняет знания проектов в сессиях Claude Code الذاكرة التلقائية هي أداة حوكمة هندسية للمؤسسات التي تحفظ معرفة المشاريع في جلسات Claude Code how to use auto-memory auto-memory setup guide enterprise architecture governance tools vendor procurement software auto-memory alternative auto-memory vs claude code what is auto-memory auto-memory install auto-memory for AI agents Auto-Memory 企业架构治理 供应商采购 项目知识管理 持久化 auto memory 结构化知识管理 MEMORY.md topic 文件 AI工具 AIエージェント Stores project knowledge in a concise index file (MEMORY.md) Creates detailed topic files for a structured knowledge base Utilizes a memory directory (~/.claude/projects/<path>/memory/) for data storage Loads MEMORY.md into the system prompt for easy access Supports topic files like architecture.md for specific knowledge domains auto-memory is a toolkit for enterprise architecture governance and vendor procurement that utilizes a persistent memory directory to store project knowledge.');
