INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('datenoio/iterabledata/openspec-workflows', 'openspec-workflows', 'datenoio', 'iterabledata', 'community', 'openspec-workflows datenoio iterabledata community bson datafile file-conversion json jsonlines messagepack orc parquet shp xls xlsx xml openspec-workflows is a Python library for reading, writing, and converting data files in various formats. It benefits developers working with diverse data file types. openspec-workflows 是一个 Python 库，用于读写和转换多种数据文件格式。它支持 BSON、JSON、NDJSON、Parquet、ORC、XLS、XLSX 和 XML 等格式 openspec-workflows は、BSON、JSON、NDJSON、Parquet、ORC、XLS、XLSX、XML などの多種のデータファイル形式を読み書きまたは変換する Python ライブラリです openspec-workflows 는 BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML 등의 다양한 데이터 파일 형식을 읽고 쓰고 변환하는 Python 라이브러리입니다 openspec-workflows es una biblioteca de Python para leer, escribir y convertir archivos de datos en varios formatos openspec-workflows est une bibliothèque Python pour lire, écrire et convertir des fichiers de données dans plusieurs formats openspec-workflows ist eine Python-Bibliothek zum Lesen, Schreiben und Konvertieren von Datendateien in verschiedenen Formaten O openspec-workflows é uma biblioteca Python que permite a leitura, escrita e conversão de arquivos de dados em vários formatos, incluindo BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX e XML Openspec-workflows - библиотека Python, позволяющая читать, записывать и конвертировать данные в различных форматах, включая BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX и XML для разработки ИИ Агентов openspec-workflows هي مكتبة بايثون تتيح قراءة وكتابة وتحويل ملفات البيانات بامتدادات متعددة مثل BSON و JSON و NDJSON و Parquet و ORC و XLS و XLSX و XML لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي how to use openspec-workflows openspec-workflows alternative openspec-workflows install openspec-workflows vs messagepack what is openspec-workflows openspec-workflows setup guide openspec-workflows file conversion openspec-workflows python library openspec-workflows data file formats openspec-workflows Python 数据文件转换库 数据文件读写 数据文件转换 BSON JSON NDJSON Parquet ORC XLS XLSX XML Supports data file conversions between BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, and XML Utilizes the `openspec list` command for file management Enables creation of proposals for new features, breaking changes, and architecture changes Allows skipping proposals for bug fixes, typos, and non-breaking dependency updates Facilitates performance optimizations and security pattern updates openspec-workflows is a Python library enabling data file conversions between formats such as BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, and XML');
